    <string name="ui_109">This is permanent: your account, photo, location, connections and groups you created will be deleted. Continue?</string>
    <string name="ui_110">Sharing starts only when you enable it. OFF immediately stops acquisition on this device. Without a connection, the remote stop waits: authorized users may read the last point until its owner-selected expiry, up to 24 hours.</string>
    <string name="ui_111">We keep only the latest location, without a history. You can read your own location after expiry. Direct connections and groups are independent sharing channels. The eye only filters your map. Private photos are accessible to the owner and authorized contacts and temporarily cached in memory. Data already received cannot be recalled from other devices.</string>
    <string name="ui_112">GPS uses the accuracy reported by Android. Frequency and availability depend on permissions, reception and power saving. Maps communicate with the style provider; offline regions are not downloaded.</string>
